  "body": "Tucked away a short stroll from the vibrant St Heliers Village, this elevated weatherboard home sits safely behind remote gates, offering a serene retreat. The heart of the residence is defined by a contemporary kitchen flooded with natural light, flowing effortlessly into an adjacent dining, family area and a spacious lounge.\r\n\r\nThis entire living zone opens through elegant bi-folding doors to a sprawling deck with direct kitchen access, where you can enjoy a peaceful green outlook, perfect for alfresco entertaining or quiet morning coffees.\r\n\r\nThe main level of the home offers 3 double bedrooms one of which flows out the aforementioned sunny decking area. A convenient combined bathroom and powder room completes this upper level, ensuring ease of living for guests and residents alike.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtful layout continues on the lower level, which serves as a dedicated sanctuary with external access. Here you will find a double bedroom serviced by a full, highly spec'd bathroom., with additional space for an office or other amenities.\r\n\r\nAdding significant value to this impressive package is a large 1.5 space garage with extra storage. Outside, the flat and fully fenced section provides a safe and secure playground for children and pets to roam freely with space for extra vehicles.\r\n\r\nMinutes away from café's, restaurants, supermarkets, beaches, the library, walking trails, parkland and recreation facilities, with the bonus of being situated within the highly sought-after zones for Churchill Park School, Glendowie College. The location is perfect for all stages of Life.",
